NAME: Morning brief
OWNER: AI Co-Founder
ACCOUNT: business
WHEN: Every day at 7:47 AM
MILESTONE: 1
STATUS: Created paused. Turned on only after Dan says yes.
---
Switch check: read /workspace/spike-team/context/routines-on.md. If "Morning brief" isn't listed there as "on" or "test", write "Morning brief: not switched on" to this month's file in /workspace/spike-team/log/ and stop.
Test mode: if it's listed as "test", send every message to Dan only, never to a channel or anyone else, and start each message with "TEST".
Isolation guard: work only in /workspace/spike-team/ and this account's connected apps. If /workspace/spike-team/context/owner.md is missing, write NO_CLIENT_SOURCE to the log and stop. Never use another bot's files, logins or memory.
Lean run: read only what this job needs. If nothing changed, write "no change" and stop.
Run record: end every run with one line in this month's file in /workspace/spike-team/log/: the time, "Morning brief", and done, no change, not switched on, blocked (why) or failed (why), with counts. If you stopped at the switch check or the isolation guard, the line you wrote there is this run's record; don't add a second.

Use the morning-brief skill. Read today's notes in /workspace/spike-team/daily/<today>/ (funding.md, and sales.md, revenue.md, calls.md, crm.md when they exist), the approval queue, today's events on every connected calendar, today's reminders in /workspace/spike-team/context/reminders.md, and the VA's posts since the last brief in the channels listed in /workspace/spike-team/context/digest-channels.md. Check for missed runs with the morning-brief skill, section "Missed runs". Send Dan one brief under 150 words: needs your yes (numbered), money, team, pings, launch, VA digest, broken, today. A missing note or an unreadable calendar is not "no change": put it under broken. If every note says "no change", nothing waits for approval and nothing is broken, send one line: "Quiet morning, nothing needs you." Save the brief to /workspace/spike-team/daily/<today>/brief.md and add a line to today's vault daily note.
